  "description": "In a land scarred by war, every new moon brings the White Wraith's vengeful spirit. One dark night, Minju is caught in his grasp. The Wraith has a shocking demand. “Lay with me tonight, and my spirit might finally rest.” As her hands find his skin, she realizes—she can feel his heartbeat. Is this man truly a ghost... or something more?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
